OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly fog gradually clearing to
OL,6,Fleave some brightness in eastern
OL,7,Fcounties this morning. Patchy light
OL,8,Frain soon arriving in west Cornwall,
OL,9,Fwith the odd spot developing elsewhere
OL,10,Fthrough the afternoon as it generally
OL,11,Fturns cloudy. Feeling warm in the east.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FPatchy light rain will slowly
OL,14,Fclear towards the southeast, leaving a
OL,15,Fmostly dry and sometimes clear night
OL,16,Fto come, though mist and fog patches
OL,17,Freturning. Chilly, especially in rural
OL,18,Fspots.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
