OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA generally dry day to come
OL,6,Fwith sunny spells which could turn
OL,7,Fhazy at times with high cloud. Light
OL,8,Fwinds with temperatures a little above
OL,9,Faverage for September.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FTurning
OL,12,Fwindier on Sunday with rain edging
OL,13,Feastwards, heavy in places. Fine again
OL,14,Fon Monday with some sunshine before
OL,15,Fwet and windy weather returns on
OL,16,FTuesday. Temperatures staying above
OL,17,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
